"Open Start and type your company name and your own limits in the yellow cells: the score a proposal needs, the days a proposal may wait, the payback you accept and your warning days.": "打开\"开始\",在黄色的单元中输入公司名称和自己的限制:建议所需的分数,建议可能等待几天,您接受的回报和您的警告日.",
"Fill Portfolio Register with every project: client, sponsor, manager, dates, budget, status, stage, priority, health and progress. Days late and the schedule state fill in.": "填写每个项目:客户,赞助商,经理,日期,预算,状态,阶段,优先级,健康和进展. 延迟几天和时间表状态填写.",
"List new ideas on Project Proposals. Set the criteria and weights on Scoring Criteria, then score every proposal on Priority Scoring; rank and the cut-off check fill in.": "在 项目提案 上列出新想法.在 评分标准 上设置标准和权重,然后在 优先评分 上评分每个提案; 排名和切断检查填写.",
"Write a business case for each proposal on Business Cases. Net present value, payback and a verdict fill in, and missing figures are flagged.": "写一个商业案例每项提案在 商业案例. 净现值,回报和判决填写,缺失的数字标记.",
"Keep one charter per project on Project Charters and record the date it was signed. A charter that waits too long turns overdue to sign.": "每个项目的章程都保持在 项目章程 上,并记录其签署日期.等待太久的章程会过期签署.",
"Agree what is in and out on Scope Register, the success measures on Success Measures, and the assumptions on Assumptions.": "在 范围登记 上同意什么是进出,在 成功措施 上的成功指标,以及在假设上的假设.",
"Rate every stakeholder on Stakeholder Register and fill RACI Matrix with one accountable person for each activity.": "在 利益相关者登记 中评分每个利益相关者,并为每个活动填写一个负责人.",
"Run the six gate checks on Stage Gates, and write each go, defer or no-go on Go No-go Decisions with its conditions and review date.": "在 舞台门 上运行六个门检查,并写出每一个进入,推迟或不进入 没有决定 的条件和审查日期.",
"Record funding requests on Funding Approvals, staffing needs on Staffing Requests, and the planned and actual spend of each quarter on Quarterly Budget.": "在 资金批准 记录资金请求,在 工作人员要求 记录人员需求,并在 季度预算 记录每个季度的计划和实际支出.",
"Rate each project against the six objectives on Strategy Alignment and write the monthly decision for each project on Portfolio Review Log.": "在 战略的协调 上对每个项目进行对比,并在 投资组合审查日志 上写出每个项目的月度决定.",
"Use the 14 calculators for business case value, priority score, project price, contingency, estimates, team size, scope change, readiness, cost of delay, break-even, capacity, funding and win rate.": "使用14个计算器来计算业务情况价值,优先评分,项目价格,意外情况,估计,团队规模,范围变更,准备,延迟成本,平衡,能力,资金和获胜率.",
"Print 10 sheets and 10 letters, follow 10 checklists and tap a message link to open a message with the text ready.": "打印10张纸张和10个字母, 按照10个检查清单,",
"Read Portfolio Dashboard and Charts every week and before each portfolio review.": "每周阅读 投资组合仪表板 和图表,并在每次投资组合审查之前阅读."
}